:"其氏，諸暨人。康熙十三年，盜硃德甫佔縣紫閬山為亂，吏發兵討之，婦見掠，與其並縶。婦好謂兵：「吾既被獲，復何言？吾夫祗此子，請俟其追至，以子歸之，吾從汝去耳。」行至長清嶺，其夫奔而至，婦復請以子授其夫。度父子行已遠，自擲崖下死。\n\n韓昌有妻李\n\n","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":2,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:shiji-5767cab9d7cbed26","bookId":"book:shiji","requestedTitle":"史記/卷040","title":"史記/卷040","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7040","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8736796","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7040?action=history","revisionId":8736796,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-27T02:52:54Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:34:04.013Z","sha256":"dce17cfd9f4c12b425774c97fcf6671f0b52ac4f9d15e5baf4e99a9d8392cab1","textSha256":"1ce15b20ecc6d819804ff93bfd8f95bf0217eddcc2fba6a2827f05f13a17d581","expandedWikitextSha256":"dce17cfd9f4c12b425774c97fcf6671f0b52ac4f9d15e5baf4e99a9d8392cab1","characters":13547,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/shiji.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:35.107Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/755d9d0f3e37d88a37b3.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/755d9d0f3e37d88a37b3.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:qingshigao-eace947bb67cb47d","bookId":"book:qingshigao"